<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-29T02:40:01.832Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:40:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to launch lethal attacks in northern Nigeria, killing civilians in Plateau, shooting Islamic cleric Yahaya Masussuka dead in Katsina, and killing at least 62 people in Binnari, Taraba, prompting mass displacement. Bandits also targeted APC supporters ahead of a rally in Katsina and abducted six residents from the Millennium City estate in Kaduna, while troops foiled a terrorist attack in Sokoto and rescued two abducted herders in Zamfara. Police in Benue arrested 34 suspected foreign nationals and rescued 29 kidnapping victims, and the Niger State Assembly praised the army for stopping a bandit raid. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNaTZHekRTSzFOQThfNS00SWJLT1hjNlRPdHIzTl9KbWh1b1lkR1dYcTBhZXdfSloyZERTX2ZMV1ZmZXpXZW5qZE95bXRqOGIwSDBPTzdldXBqYS14eWhwWFhUdzUwLWNiRDNvenZXb0F2UWJVMXNnMVJYb2JXeFc2dzl6VEQ4a3VRcTBnUURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE83bEJFN3QwcG93Mkh5dDJ4SVdKWFRHZkxTZmtlZ0dHb0N3V1BFTzFBdTB3aGYyRHNVUHVRSm1OZjNwc0swVWFhNFJ0N0JOV3FJLUZzdWVySk9WWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBPeXVzUlRTUkp1QjItMjlzRGJYU1hmMmMtd3ROX1ZTUXFZZkRxVnVpUlU5dXlPRmRZem9BVFZPTm9SSzFfWGYyTlNvMXpWcjVCUTFnZGtyajNvZDBHRGfSAWNBVV95cUxPU3YzTV92alZ0UERRbVk4c2drM2J6X05GN0NjVFFGMmRKZmxGbDZEN1BWLWlnSEF1eW1kamF2TjJzcEJMbTRMSF9CcTVSTDRVbkYzU2VlTmJFWHI3QjR0b3lUdEU?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNeTduMVNiT0RMTVY5dWNBRHpqNTQwYV90eTZmbWZfWnl1S2c4RmRMZEdpRTFrOUZob1o4aTdWS3JyemNGSlVLV1JYSTNTSE51M3FTVEg5VHIzSENRRGh3Xy1HcXloaHl4SW4wYnR5YVpnUll6U1NESDRsWDY3bHJWTm9mUmNJR2NFRExJbng4QkhjRjRyMFh6Tk5iZER1S